## ⏱ Time and Space Complexity

| Metric            | Complexity |
|-------------------|------------|
| Time (preprocessing) | `O(n * m)` — where `n` is the number of words and `m` is average word length  
| Time (querying)      | `O(q * m)` — for `q` queries  
| Space                | `O(n * m)` — for storing maps and sets

